@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 注册并保存会话 token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "correct-horse-battery-staple",
  "displayName": "Demo User"
}

> {% client.global.set("freshmind_token", response.body.token); %}

### 2. 新增一条用于 CRUD 演示的库存，并保存 ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory
X-Token: {{freshmind_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingredientName": "Milk",
  "category": "OTHERS",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unit": "bottle",
  "purchasedOn": "2026-10-25",
  "expiresOn": "2026-11-01"
}

> {% client.global.set("freshmind_item_id", response.body.id); %}

### 3. 为菜谱推荐准备目录内食材
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory
X-Token: {{freshmind_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingredientName": "Rice",
  "category": "OTHERS",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unit": "bowl",
  "purchasedOn": "2026-10-25",
  "expiresOn": "2027-04-01"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory
X-Token: {{freshmind_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingredientName": "Egg",
  "category": "OTHERS",
  "quantity": 6,
  "unit": "pcs",
  "purchasedOn": "2026-10-25",
  "expiresOn": "2026-10-28"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory
X-Token: {{freshmind_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingredientName": "Tomato",
  "category": "VEGETABLES",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unit": "pcs",
  "purchasedOn": "2026-10-25",
  "expiresOn": "2026-10-28"
}

### 4. 查询库存
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory?page=0&size=20&sortBy=expiry&direction=asc
X-Token: {{freshmind_token}}

### 5. 修改并消耗库存
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory/{{freshmind_item_id}}
X-Token: {{freshmind_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingredientName": "Milk",
  "category": "OTHERS",
  "quantity": 3,
  "unit": "bottle",
  "purchasedOn": "2026-10-25",
  "expiresOn": "2026-11-01"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory/{{freshmind_item_id}}/consume
X-Token: {{freshmind_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1
}

### 6. 首页只返回库存统计，不等待 AI
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard
X-Token: {{freshmind_token}}

### 7. 获取菜谱推荐
# local profile 返回确定性演示候选；默认 profile 使用 DASHSCOPE_API_KEY 调用千问。
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recommendations?limit=8
X-Token: {{freshmind_token}}

### 8. 查询站内临期提醒
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
X-Token: {{freshmind_token}}

### 9. 退出登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
X-Token: {{freshmind_token}}

